-- SYNTAX -------------------- errors/parse_error_3.march

I don't recognize `then` here — March uses do/end blocks instead. [then_keyword]

4 |     if true then
                ^^^^

    if cond do
        expr1
    else
        expr2
    end

    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

4 -     if true then
4 +     if true do

    run `march --explain then_keyword`

after fix: exit 0
